    {
      "short": "Recap",
      "chapter": "recap",
      "title": "Recap",
      "body": [
        "<ul class=\"takeaways\">\n          <li>State kept in a server’s memory <b>pins users</b> to that server.</li>\n          <li><b>Sticky sessions</b> hide the problem until a server dies.</li>\n          <li>Move state to a <b>shared store</b>, or carry it in a <b>signed token</b>.</li>\n          <li>Files go to <b>object storage</b>, never a server’s local disk.</li>\n          <li><b>Stateless</b> servers can be added, removed and lost freely.</li>\n        </ul>"
      ],
      "callout": {
        "kind": "next",
        "text": "Next up: <b>Caching</b> — the database behind all these stateless servers is about to become the bottleneck."
      },
